* Board 4, circuit 6: voltage controlled filter (Fig. 9-11), as drawn.
* in: pin 4 (mixer bus); ctl: pin 5, the control node; cont: pin 16 (AMOUNT OF CONTOUR's
* wiper); e7: pin 7 (to EMPHASIS R14); e6: pin 6 (back from R14); out: Q7 / Q8's collectors.
* tr, ts, tg: RANGE (R39), SCALE (R49) and REGEN CAL (R73) positions, 0..1.
.subckt vcf in ctl cont e7 e6 out vp vn params: tr=0.5 ts=0.4 tg=0.5
* bias string
r4 vp s1 220
r16 s1 s2 150
r32 s2 s3 150
r41 s3 s4 150
r52 s4 nb 150
r67 nb 0 200
c24 nb 0 220u
* ladder
q2 vp s1 n4l TIS97
q3 vp s1 n4r TIS97
c3 n4l n4r 0.068u
q10 n4l s2 n3l TIS97
q11 n4r s2 n3r TIS97
c7 n3l n3r 0.068u
q19 n3l s3 n2l TIS97
q20 n3r s3 n2r TIS97
c11 n2l n2r 0.068u
q23 n2l s4 n1l TIS97
q24 n2r s4 n1r TIS97
c16 n1l n1r 0.068u
q29 n1l b29 et TIS97
q30 n1r b30 et TIS97
c27 in b29 10u
r54 b29 nb 470
* tail and cutoff converter
r60 et c28 680
q28 c28 b28 0 TIS92
q26 c26 ctl b28 TIS93
r45 c26 vn 330
r46 rw b28 68k
r39a vp rw {10k*(1-tr)+1}
r39b rw 0 {10k*tr+1}
r49 ctl sc {500*ts+1m}
r70 sc 0 1.8k
c18 ctl 0 100p
r74 cont ctl 47k
* output stage ("gain recovery amplifier")
c5 n4l b8 0.22u
r31 b8 0 47k
c1 n4r b6 0.22u
r38 b6 0 47k
q8 out b8 e8 TIS97
r24 e8 vn 220k
q7 out e8 e57 TIS97
q6 vp b6 e6f TIS97
r20 e6f vn 100k
q5 vp e6f e57 TIS97
r26 e57 vn 1k
r3 out nu 1k
r7 nu nt 180
r6 vp nt 47
c9 nt 0 100u
* emphasis path
c10 nu e7 10u
r73a e6 b30 {1k*(1-tg)+1m}
r73b b30 n76 {1k*tg+1m}
r76 n76 nb 330
.ends
